    "result_text": "Both tests pass. The full-stack change is complete:\n\n**Database** (`V3__projects.sql`): new `projects` table with a `client_id` FK to `clients`.\n\n**Server** (OfficeFloor REST):\n- `Project` record carries the joined `clientName` so the UI shows the name, not the id.\n- `ProjectRepository` \u2014 `findAll()` joins projects\u2192clients; `create()` inserts and returns the project with its client name.\n- `ProjectsGetLogic` / `ProjectsPostLogic` + `projects.GET.yml` / `projects.POST.yml` (under `rest/api/` so paths start with `/api/`).\n- `TestSupportController` extended to seed `projects` (using explicit fixture ids) and to truncate both tables on reset \u2014 with referential integrity lifted, since H2 refuses to `TRUNCATE` an FK-referenced table.\n\n**Front-end** (`features/projects/`): a new self-contained page + auto-discovered `route.tsx`. It lists projects showing the client's name, and offers a form with a client `<select>` (option values = client ids) to add a project.\n\nAll work is additive and local, no pinned scaffolding or the test spec was touched. Matched every `data-testid` the spec expects (`nav-projects`, `projects-table`, `project-row-*`, `project-name`, `project-client`, `project-form-name`, `project-form-client`, `project-form-submit`).",
